    "q-134279": {
      "dom_id": "question-134279",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "There are $308$ lollipops at the store. The store manager wants to make packages containing $4$ lollipops each. In total, he can make$\\,$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$\\,$packages.",
      "worked_solution": "We know that there are $308$ lollipops in total. Since each package must contain $4$ lollipops,the store manager can make $308÷4$ packages.\n\nWe start by writing down the question using long division notation:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"150\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\,\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{3\\,\\phantom{|}0\\,\\phantom{|}8}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p></p></td>\n<td width=\"250\" align=\"left\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"20\">\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\nNotice that $3$ (the number of hundreds in $308$) is less than the divisor $4.$ Therefore, we should consider both the hundreds and tens:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"150\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$7$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\,\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{3\\,\\phantom{|}0\\,\\phantom{|}8}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$↓$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p></p></td>\n<td width=\"250\" align=\"left\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Divide: $30÷4=7\\,\\text{R}\\,2$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Write over tens: $7$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"25\">\n<td>Multiply: $4\\times 7=28$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Subtract: $30-28=2$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"25\">\n<td>Bring down: $8$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\nNext, we consider the ones:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"150\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$7$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$7$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\,\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{3\\,\\phantom{|}0\\,\\phantom{|}8}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\boxed{\\text{0}}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p></p></td>\n<td width=\"250\" align=\"left\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Divide: $28÷4=7$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Write over ones: $7$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"25\">\n<td>Multiply: $4\\times 7=28$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\"> \n<td>Subtract: $28-28=0$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\nWe get the remainder $0$, so the division is done.\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n308÷4=77.\n$$",
